# Local dev tooling and tokens — never commit.
#
# The leading dot matters and was missing: the helper writes `.tokens.json`,
# `tokens.json` did not match it, and `git add -A` committed live JWTs for
# every test account. Patterns here are matched literally, not by basename.
.tokens.json
tokens.json
measure.mjs
shot2.mjs

# Playwright scratch scripts and screenshots, written per session.
.*.mjs
.*.png
